{"unit_id":"jijijitian__dsh-plugin-syncup#feature-1","repo":"jijijitian/dsh-plugin-syncup","commit":"9e1f7f098643689b569a1816d82f0dcc913cb87c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-syncup 的功能「跨主机清单预览与应用」：读取远端 Gist 清单并与本机插件比较，展示安装、升级、降级、启用和冲突条目。用户按预览结果选择后，插件才将所选变更交给 DSH 插件管理器处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/preview.js:1-18","index.js:326-360"]}
